# Narvyaka has no build-time environment variables.
#
# Everything configurable lives in two places on purpose:
#
#   site.config.ts   domain, contact email, social links   (committed)
#   wrangler.toml    D1 + R2 bindings, public media URL     (committed)
#   .dev.vars        secrets for local `pages:dev`          (never committed)
#
# Production secrets are set on Cloudflare:
#   npx wrangler pages secret put STUDIO_TOKEN
